{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794857096982,"sessionID":"ses_e1a303974ffe7fw3NHmuXnjadA","part":{"partID":"prt_1e5d19afb001kelJmso24hD4Ps","sessionID":"ses_e1a303974ffe7fw3NHmuXnjadA","messageID":"msg_1e5d19243001FrI4BtYCzlB7U8","type":"tool","id":"call_02061c2f0ff149479563f0d3","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Deep Review Strategy - merged-12\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent review state for the detached fan-out lineage `merged-12` of review pass twelve on `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`.\n\n### Usage\n\n- Per iteration: read Next Focus, review the assigned dimension/files, update findings, mark dimensions complete, and set the next focus.\n- Mutability: mutable inside this lineage directory only.\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview of the two merges of `origin/main` (`640cd0a2499`) into the command-surfacing branch: `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md`, `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/SKILL.md` and `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/graph-metadata.json` must equal main except the branch's README phrase narrowings and the `/create:sk-skill` command name; the generated intent signals must follow the router; and `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-install-contract.test.cjs` must check the presentation and the workflow against the link manifest.\n\n---\n\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Re-reporting the recorded limits named in `review/review-brief-12.txt` (suffix-plus-extension reads as command, `node -e` arrow redirect, macOS-only isolation check, underscore emphasis, moved baseline rows judged without text, the open P2 list of `038-alignment-p1-remediation/scratch/alignment-final-dispositions.md`, and the open P2 of review passes ten and eleven).\n- Re-reviewing the `mention` area (`command-attach.ts` and its guards) except where a merged-file claim depends on it.\n- Reading or printing holdout fixture content; the holdout gate is read by count only.\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- `config.stopPolicy: convergence` with `config.convergenceThreshold: 0.1` and `config.maxIterations: 8`, whichever the `convergence.cjs` stop decision reaches first.\n- A failed required quality gate (evidence, scope, coverage) blocks STOP and must be answered or reported.\n\n---\n\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n[Populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n[Populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\n\n---\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n[Review angles investigated and eliminated]\n\n---\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Dimension: correctness\n- Focus area: the doctor install contract test (`doctor-install-contract.test.cjs`) against `symlink-manifest.json`, the presentation asset and the workflow asset, plus the two sk-doc merges for content drift from `origin/main`.\n- Reason: iteration 1 opens the run with the correctness dimension over the declared scope.\n- Required evidence: file:line for every claim and the `origin/main` comparison for the merged files.\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md`, `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/SKILL.md`, `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/graph-metadata.json`, `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-install-contract.test.cjs`.\n- Comparison bases: branch commits `2f3f893c153` (pre-merge) and `05475f9d044` (post-merge), `origin/main` `640cd0a2499`.\n- Behavior claims: the two sk-doc merges equal main except the branch's README phrase narrowings and `/create:sk-skill`; generated intent signals follow the router; the doctor contract test checks presentation and workflow against the link manifest.\n- Reuse and conventions: prior lineage `fixes-11` raised the doctor-contract workflow-coverage gap and the retired-name delivery gap; pass twelve reports both.\n\n---\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | - |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | - |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/SKILL.md` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/graph-metadata.json` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-install-contract.test.cjs` | - | - | - | pending |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Max iterations: 8\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-merged-12-1794856957949-n58dw7, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 40 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-16T19:24:26.000Z\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merged-12/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merged-12/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merged-12/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"# Deep Review Strategy - merged-12\\n\\n## 1. OVERVIEW\\n\\n### Purpose\\n\\nPersistent review state for the detached fan-out lineage `merged-12` of review pass twelve on `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`.\\n\\n### Usage\\n\\n- Per iteration: read Next Focus, review the assigned dimension/files, update findings, mark dimensions complete, and set the next focus.\\n- Mutability: mutable inside this lineage directory only.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nReview of the two merges of `origin/main` (`640cd0a2499`) into the command-surfacing branch: `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md`, `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/SKILL.md` and `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/graph-metadata.json` must equal main except the branch's README phrase narrowings and the `/create:sk-skill` command name; the generated intent signals must follow the router; and `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-install-contract.test.cjs` must check the presentation and the workflow against the link manifest.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- Re-reporting the recorded limits named in `review/review-brief-12.txt` (suffix-plus-extension reads as command, `node -e` arrow redirect, macOS-only isolation check, underscore emphasis, moved baseline rows judged without text, the open P2 list of `038-alignment-p1-remediation/scratch/alignment-final-dispositions.md`, and the open P2 of review passes ten and eleven).\\n- Re-reviewing the `mention` area (`command-attach.ts` and its guards) except where a merged-file claim depends on it.\\n- Reading or printing holdout fixture content; the holdout gate is read by count only.\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- `config.stopPolicy: convergence` with `config.convergenceThreshold: 0.1` and `config.maxIterations: 8`, whichever the `convergence.cjs` stop decision reaches first.\\n- A failed required quality gate (evidence, scope, coverage) blocks STOP and must be answered or reported.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n\\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\\n\\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n[Populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n[Populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\\n\\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Completed pivots: 0\\n- Failed pivots: 0\\n- Audited overrides: 0\\n- Swept: none yet\\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n\\n[Review angles investigated and eliminated]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Dimension: correctness\\n- Focus area: the doctor install contract test (`doctor-install-contract.test.cjs`) against `symlink-manifest.json`, the presentation asset and the workflow asset, plus the two sk-doc merges for content drift from `origin/main`.\\n- Reason: iteration 1 opens the run with the correctness dimension over the declared scope.\\n- Required evidence: file:line for every claim and the `origin/main` comparison for the merged files.\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\\n\\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\\n\\n- Target pointers: `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md`, `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/SKILL.md`, `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/graph-metadata.json`, `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-install-contract.test.cjs`.\\n- Comparison bases: branch commits `2f3f893c153` (pre-merge) and `05475f9d044` (post-merge), `origin/main` `640cd0a2499`.\\n- Behavior claims: the two sk-doc merges equal main except the branch's README phrase narrowings and `/create:sk-skill`; generated intent signals follow the router; the doctor contract test checks presentation and workflow against the link manifest.\\n- Reuse and conventions: prior lineage `fixes-11` raised the doctor-contract workflow-coverage gap and the retired-name delivery gap; pass twelve reports both.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n\\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | - |\\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | - |\\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | - |\\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | - |\\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | - |\\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | - |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n\\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\\n| `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md` | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/SKILL.md` | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/graph-metadata.json` | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-install-contract.test.cjs` | - | - | - | pending |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Max iterations: 8\\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-merged-12-1794856957949-n58dw7, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\\n- Per-iteration budget: 40 tool calls, 10 minutes\\n- Severity threshold: P2\\n- Review target type: spec-folder\\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\\n- Started: 2026-11-16T19:24:26.000Z\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merged-12/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794857081595,"end":1794857096982}}}}
