{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794857418867,"sessionID":"ses_e1a303974ffe7fw3NHmuXnjadA","part":{"partID":"prt_1e5d6b556001w6p9ARkp6ptCvC","sessionID":"ses_e1a303974ffe7fw3NHmuXnjadA","messageID":"msg_1e5d6aa68001wq3gQ4ce0HYY2U","type":"tool","id":"call_63e3cad66b2741a493ea820c","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n- Diffing each merged sk-doc file against `origin/main 640cd0a2499` and classifying every hunk (iteration 1): it makes \"only the narrowings and the rename differ\" a checkable claim instead of a reading.\n- Running `generate-router-intent-signals.cjs --check --hub sk-doc --json` (iteration 1): it converts the router-versus-intent-signal obligation into one mechanical result (`added=0, orphans=0`).\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n- Reading the doctor contract-test title as evidence of its assertions (iteration 1): the workflow half asserts a phrase that the inspected field could never contain, so the title over-claims. The failure is now recorded as the iteration 1 P2.","oldString":"## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n[Populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n[Populated after iteration 1 completes]","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merged-12/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merged-12/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merged-12/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merged-12/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merged-12/deep-review-strategy.m