/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merged-12/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merged-12/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -101,9 +101,12 @@\n ---\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n ## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n-- Dimension: security. - Focus area: the same four scope files, read for trust boundaries and disclosure: whether the merged sk-doc routing prose gained or lost any instruction that could widen a write authority, and whether the doctor contract test reads any operator- or environment-controlled path without a boundary. - Reason: rotation to the second dimension; the correctness pass found one P2 and no blocking surface. - Required evidence: file:line for every claim, and the generator's exit status as the mechanical signal for the router/intent pair. Review verdict: PASS\n+- Dimension: traceability.\n+- Focus area: map REQ-005 and REQ-006 of packet `039` to the merged files; check the doctor test's checklist evidence against the merged workflow and presentation; carry the iteration 1 P2 only if a new input widens it.\n+- Reason: rotation to the third dimension; security produced no new finding.\n+- Required evidence: spec path:line, test path:line, and the two tool exit statuses already captured.\n \n <!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n ## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n \n","status":"modified","additions":4,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merged-12/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"## 11. NEXT FOCUS\\n- Dimension: traceability.\\n- Focus area: map REQ-005 and REQ-006 of packet `039` to the merged files; check the doc