tation and OpenCode-component authoring parent hub. One advisor identity that routes through mode-registry.json + hub-router.json to fifteen workflow modes across fourteen nested workflow packets (sk-create-skill/sk-create-skill-parent, sk-create-readme, sk-create-agent, sk-create-command, sk-create-feature-catalog, sk-create-manual-testing-playbook, sk-create-benchmark, sk-create-changelog, sk-create-diff, sk-create-repo-rule, sk-create-frontmatter, sk-create-goal, sk-create-with-human-voice, sk-create-quality-control). The universal sk-create-quality-control pipeline lives once in shared/ and is consumed by every packet. It matters because it gives the workspace one discoverable identity for authoring and validating high-quality documentation and components, with per-artifact workflows isolated in self-contained packets.\",\n    \"source_docs\": [\n      \"SKILL.md\",\n      \"README.md\",\n      \"mode-registry.json\",\n      \"hub-router.json\",\n      \"description.json\",\n      \"sk-create-skill/SKILL.md\",\n      \"sk-create-quality-control/SKILL.md\",\n      \"sk-create-changelog/SKILL.md\",\n      \"sk-create-diff/SKILL.md\",\n      \"sk-create-repo-rule/SKILL.md\",\n      \"sk-create-with-human-voice/SKILL.md\"\n    ],\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-04-13T00:00:00Z\",\n    \"last_updated_at\": \"2026-09-26T00:00:00Z\",\n    \"sanitizer_version\": \"sanitizeSkillLabel:v2\"\n  },\n  \"intent_signals_generated\": [\n    \"create skill\",\n    \"create readme\",\n    \"create agent\",\n    \"create command\",\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"      {\n        \"name\": \"sk-create-quality-control\",\n        \"kind\": \"reference\",\n        \"path\": \".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-quality-control/SKILL.md\",\n        \"source\": \"derived\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"sk-create-changelog\",\n        \"kind\": \"reference\",\n        \"path\": \".skilled/s